@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Отримати всі книги
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/books
Accept: application/json

### Отримати книгу за ID 
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/books/B-002
Accept: application/json

### Створити книгу
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "978-966-99-9999-9",
  "title": "Нова книга",
  "year": 2026
}

### Оновити 
PUT {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/books/700a363b
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isbn": "978-966-99-9999-9",
  "title": "Оновлена книга",
  "year": 2007
}

### Видалити 
DELETE {{Api_HostAddress}}/api/books/12345